  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\n<!-- Describe here the feature you are requesting. -->\r\nHey, I'm trying to implement a [client-side implementation](https://github.com/syphon-org/syphon/pull/660) of [synapse's limited MSC2228 support](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/6409).\r\n\r\nI feel that homeserver support for this functionality should be exposed under `/_matrix/client/r0/capabilities` (or at least somewhere) because the last thing I want to do in my implementation is completely mislead its users.",
